          "Hyperexcitable circuits and channel genes",
          "AEDs suppress seizures, not always underlying disease."
        ],
        [
          "GBS mechanism",
          "Post-infectious peripheral demyelination",
          "IVIg/plasmapheresis timing matters."
        ],
